{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17774","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 一 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文物京华盛，讴歌国步康。\n瑶池供寿酒，银汉丽宸章。\n灵雨含双阙，雷霆肃万方。\n代推仙祚远，春共圣恩长。\n凤扆临花暖，龙罏旁日香。\n遥知千万岁，天意奉君王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}